          "inLanguage": "en",
          "name": "How do I cite the project or an exact archived release?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "inLanguage": "en",
            "text": "Cite José Ignacio Martín Gandul, Thirty-Nine Years of Simulated Annealing on a Causal Set: A Revival of Bombelli (1987) with 2026 Tools (2026). The concept DOI is 10.5281/zenodo.20307735; release 2.1.3 has DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22921372. Cite the 1987 thesis or original causal-set paper separately for the historical work.",
